  "plot_summary": "[ASSET: left | AvengersAdFullPage | width=33%] [ASSET: right | AnnualsAndXmen | width=33%] The annuals were <i>greatly</i> hyped this month, as is the announcement of two new magazines coming soon -- the <i>Avengers</i> and the <i>X-Men</i>!\n\nAnother thing that might have quietly slipped past readers this month was the lengthening of the Iron Man feature in <i>Tales of Suspense</i>.&nbsp; Without any fanfare, the superhero story was lengthened from 13 to 18 pages, eliminating one of the two backup stories.",
